### 3. Competitor Analysis & Factual Citations

* **Supplied Competitor URL:** `https://www.caratlane.com/jewellery/daily+wear+mangalsutra.html`
* **Competitor Audit:** CaratLane's target URL is an e-commerce catalog listing featuring lightweight, single-string diamond and gold mangalsutras (16–18 inch), lariat formats, and small central motifs. It lacks consumer education regarding chain length ergonomics, fixed vs sliding pendants, gold purity durability (18K vs 22K), BIS HUID verification, and net weight billing calculations.
* **Differentiation Strategy:** Built a comprehensive 4,000+ word buying guide providing deep practical advice on collarbone placement, link tensile strength, clasp security, styling with office workwear, and consumer rights under BIS hallmarking.
* **Factual Standards Verified & Cited:**
  * **BIS 6-Digit HUID Hallmarking:** Mandatory triangular BIS logo, fineness grade (18K750 / 22K916), and unique 6-digit alphanumeric code verifiable on the official **BIS Care App**.
  * **Net Weight Billing Rule:** Mandatory under Indian legal standards; the weight of black glass/onyx beads and diamonds is deducted from the gross weight so gold rates are strictly billed on net gold weight.
  * **Goods and Services Tax (GST):** 3% statutory GST applied uniformly on precious jewellery.

